{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","language":"zh-CN","entryId":"codex-hostile-species","chapterId":"handbook-monster-4034015","referenceCommit":"312b4597691e0a29cf9828a15b592757dba86949","rows":[{"id":"codex-hostile-species-handbook-monster-4034015-handbook-monster-4034015-0","text":"伴随黑潮而来、狩猎泰坦火种的无名剑士，面具下石像般的面容与救世主无异，几近崩毁，仿佛将死的薪柴。\n空洞的回响自火焰中来：一切皆为徒劳。","speaker":""}]}
